<BaseLayout title="Consulting — Radley Ciego" description="Data pipeline engineering, geospatial integration, and research infrastructure consulting.">
  <article>
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Consulting</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle" style="margin-top:0.25rem;">
        You have research data but no infrastructure to analyze it at scale. I build it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      I work with research institutions, startups, and policy organizations on problems
      at the intersection of data engineering, geospatial analysis, and empirical research
      design. My experience at Oak Ridge National Laboratory and NYC government gives me
      a practical understanding of both production infrastructure and rigorous methodology.
    </p>

    <h2>Services</h2>

    <h3>Data Pipeline Engineering</h3>
    <p>
      ETL/ELT design, Airflow orchestration, schema harmonization across heterogeneous sources,
      columnar storage migration (Parquet/zstd), and metadata management. Experience processing
      multi-terabyte multi-source research datasets.
    </p>

    <h3>Geospatial Data Integration</h3>
    <p>
      Multi-source geospatial feature matching (fuzzy + spatial proximity algorithms),
      OSM data wrangling, GeoParquet pipeline design, spatial quality assurance frameworks.
      Uncommon expertise that sits at the gap between GIS and data engineering.
    </p>

    <h3>Research Infrastructure Design</h3>
    <p>
      Docker-based reproducible environments, data governance frameworks, DUA-compliant
      data management, versioned metadata schemas, and cross-institutional data sharing
      infrastructure.
    </p>

    <h3>Causal Analysis &amp; Research Design Support</h3>
    <p>
      Difference-in-Differences study design, matched control construction, time-series
      cross-validation, SHAP/ML interpretability, equity stratification. Applicable to
      policy evaluation, public health research, urban systems, and infrastructure resilience.
    </p>

    <h2>Selected Project Experience</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Mobility Resilience Under Extreme Weather</strong> &mdash; Causal framework
      estimating weather shock impacts on NYC rideshare demand across 262 zones with equity
      stratification. <a href="/projects/mobility-resilience">Full case study &rarr;</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Power Outage Detection via Traffic Patterns</strong> &mdash; Novel method
      using GPS probe data to detect distribution-level outages through driver behavior
      at dark traffic signals. <a href="/projects/outage-detection">Full case study &rarr;</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>National Infrastructure Data Integration (ORNL)</strong> &mdash; Multi-source
      geospatial integration across 4+ national infrastructure datasets with confusion matrix
      evaluation of 12 algorithmic configurations. Details available on request.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Interested in working together? Email me at
      <a href="mailto:radleykc@gmail.com">radleykc@gmail.com</a> with a brief description
      of your project and timeline.
    </p>
  </article>
